[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m All values appearing in syntactic_clues, reasoning, and the final solution MUST be drawn from attribute_values and interpreted as entity tokens representing unknown house positions.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 
