[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 1) n_houses — the total number of houses in the puzzle.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 2) attribute_values — returned exactly as given, without modification.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 3) syntactic_clues — a normalized, Z3-style textual encoding of each clue.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 4) reasoning — interleaved reasoning consisting of natural-language explanations and syntactic (solver-checkable) deduction steps.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 5) solution — the final house-by-house assignment derived exclusively from syntactic_clues, and syntactic reasoning steps (S1..Sk).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m You MUST return the result STRICTLY as a single valid JSON object wrapped inside:
