[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m - It must be identical:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m   - Same attribute keys
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m   - Same ordering of keys
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m   - Same ordering of values within each list
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m   - Same casing and spelling
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m - Do NOT normalize, rename, reorder, add, or remove anything in "attribute_values".
