[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m - The people have childern named: Fred, Meredith, Bella
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m Clues:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 1. Arnold is the person whose favorite color is red.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 2. The person whose child is named Fred is somewhere to the left of Eric.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 3. The person whose favorite color is red is in the second house.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 4. The person whose child is named Bella is in the first house.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m 5. The person who loves white is the person whose child is named Meredith.
