[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S2: fish == water.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "With that, we know: House 1 has fish, animal, and watermelon smoothie. Now we look at Clue 2, which introduces a relative ordering: the person whose smoothie is watermelon is somewhere to the left of the person whose smoothie is cherry. This doesn’t give a house yet, but it constrains the ordering.",
