[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S4: Or(watermelon == 1, watermelon == 2).",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "But we already know the person in house 1 has fish, and children are unique. So the watermelon smoothie lover cannot be in house 1. That forces them into house 2.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S5: watermelon == 2.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "This tells us that the person in house 2 has watermelon smoothie. Clue 1 then ties the horse owner to the person who drinks Lime smoothies. Since the horse owner is in house 3, the person who drinks Lime must be in house 3.",
