[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 5 connects the camping enthusiast to the person who drinks Desert smoothies. Since the camping enthusiast is not in the first house, the Desert smoothie lover must be in house 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S7: camping!= 1.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 7 gives us another concrete placement: the dog owner is somewhere to the left of the person who enjoys beach vacations. Since the dog owner is not in the fifth house, the dog owner must be in either house 1, 2, 3, or 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S8: dog > white.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 8 gives us another concrete placement: Eric is the person who likes Cherry smoothies. So Eric must be in house 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S9: Eric == cherry.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 9 gives us another concrete placement: Alice is the person who drinks Tea. So Alice must be in house 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S10: Alice == tea.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 10 gives us another concrete placement: the person who enjoys mountain retreats is somewhere to the right of the person who drinks Coffee. Since the person who drinks Coffee is in house 2, the person who enjoys mountain retreats must be in either house 3 or house 5.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S11: mountain > coffee.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 11 gives us another concrete placement: Peter is somewhere to the left of the person who drinks Coffee. Since the person who drinks Coffee is in house 2, Peter must be in either house 1 or house 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S12: Peter < coffee.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 12 gives us another concrete placement: Eric is the person who enjoys Beach vacations. So Eric must be in house 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S13: Eric == beach.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 13 gives us another concrete placement: Alice is the person who enjoys Mountain retreats. So Alice must be in house 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S14: Alice == mountain.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 14 gives us another concrete placement: the watermelon smoothie lover is two houses away from Alice. Since Alice is in house 3, the watermelon smoothie lover must be in either house 1 or house 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S15: watermelon + 2 == Alice.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 15 gives us another concrete placement: the camping enthusiast is not in the first house. So the camping enthusiast must be in either house 2, 3, or 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S16: camping == 2 or 3 or 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "Clue 17 gives us another concrete placement: the fish enthusiast and the Dragonfruit smoothie lover are next to each other. Since the fish enthusiast is in house 1, the Dragonfruit smoothie lover must be in either house 1 or house 2.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=344394)[0m     "S17: fish + 1 == dragonfruit.",
